<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_tpl_app_python">TplAppPython</link></para>

<para>This class provides methods to generate menu items and actions for managing Python tools within the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. It includes functionalities for accessing Python console, IDLE, and other Python-related executables. </para>
